<title>HONG KONG: Kantone announces first interim results.</title>
<headline>Kantone announces first interim results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   12.1</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    44.65</p>
<p>    Turnover		     309.63</p>
<p>    Company name		 Kantone Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Kantone Holdings, a spinoff of Champion Technology Holdings Ltd, is mainly involved in the design, manufacture and distribution of radio telcommunications systems and equipment, with production facilities in the United Kingdom and Malaysia. It was listed on the stock exchange on January 23, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
